AppNeta Intelligent Alarm ({S 304}) - {S 306} on item {S 308}

SYMPTOMS:

An AppNeta Intelligent Alarms Outage rule was triggered, indicating a complete loss of
connectivity on the monitored network path or web target.

PROBABLE CAUSES:

Path down, target unreachable end-to-end, or an upstream network failure isolating the
monitored item, as determined by AppNeta's own monitoring criteria for this rule.

RECOMMENDED ACTIONS:

Review this alarm's details in AppNeta's Intelligent Alarms console to determine root cause.
This alarm clears automatically when AppNeta reports the underlying condition resolved.
